{"id":"26b95a6456d78585","group":"93","path":"93/93-prop-canonical-model.md","title":"Canonical Membership-Model Truth Lemma","display":"Canonical Membership-Model Truth Lemma","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-prop-canonical-model","aliases":["93-prop-canonical-model"],"display":"Canonical Membership-Model Truth Lemma","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-kripke-model]]","[[93-df-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-prop-canonical-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-prop-canonical-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Canonical Membership-Model Truth Lemma"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f3abfd23a82d3619\" href=\"?note=f3abfd23a82d3619\" title=\"93-df-kripke-model\">93-df-kripke-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c2ca1af9af149e69\" href=\"?note=c2ca1af9af149e69\" title=\"93-df-formula\">93-df-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"prop-canonical-model-—-Canonical-Membership-Model-Truth-Lemma\">prop-canonical-model — Canonical Membership-Model Truth Lemma</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ModalFm}_{93}=T_{\\tau^{\\Box}_{93}}(\\mathrm{At}_{93})\">\\(\\operatorname{ModalFm}_{93}=T_{\\tau^{\\Box}_{93}}(\\mathrm{At}_{93})\\)</span> is the local modal formula carrier of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f3abfd23a82d3619\" href=\"?note=f3abfd23a82d3619\" title=\"93-df-kripke-model\">93-df-kripke-model</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\operatorname{ModalFm}_{93})\">\\(W\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\operatorname{ModalFm}_{93})\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq W^2\">\\(R\\subseteq W^2\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V:\\mathrm{At}_{93}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\">\\(V:\\mathrm{At}_{93}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M_W=\\langle W,R,V\\rangle\">\\(\\mathfrak M_W=\\langle W,R,V\\rangle\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KrModel}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{KrModel}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Vdash_{\\mathfrak M_W}\">\\(\\Vdash_{\\mathfrak M_W}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MNeg}_{93},\\operatorname{MAnd}_{93},\\operatorname{MBox}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{MNeg}_{93},\\operatorname{MAnd}_{93},\\operatorname{MBox}_{93}\\)</span> are the model, satisfaction, and tagged constructor notions of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f3abfd23a82d3619\" href=\"?note=f3abfd23a82d3619\" title=\"93-df-kripke-model\">93-df-kripke-model</a>.</li>\n<li>The antecedent below records exactly the Boolean membership clauses and the canonical <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\">\\(\\Box\\)</span>-existence clause needed by the truth lemma.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}model}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\Bigl[\nW\\neq\\varnothing\\land W\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\operatorname{ModalFm}_{93})\n\\land R\\subseteq W^2\\land V:\\mathrm{At}_{93}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\n\\land\\mathfrak M_W=\\langle W,R,V\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall w,v\\in W\\;\n\\Bigl(\\langle w,v\\rangle\\in R\\leftrightarrow\n\\{\\psi\\in\\operatorname{ModalFm}_{93}:\\operatorname{MBox}_{93}(\\psi)\\in w\\}\\subseteq v\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall p\\in\\mathrm{At}_{93}\\;\n\\bigl(V(p)=\\{w\\in W:p\\in w\\}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall w\\in W\\;\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\operatorname{ModalFm}_{93}\\;\\Bigl(\n(\\operatorname{MNeg}_{93}(\\varphi)\\in w\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\\notin w)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}\\land\n(\\operatorname{MAnd}_{93}(\\varphi,\\psi)\\in w\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\\in w\\land\\psi\\in w)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}\\land\n(\\operatorname{MBox}_{93}(\\varphi)\\in w\\leftrightarrow\\forall v\\in W\\;(\\langle w,v\\rangle\\in R\\to\\varphi\\in v))\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{KrModel}_{93}(\\mathfrak M_W)\\land\n\\forall w\\in W\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{ModalFm}_{93}\\;\n\\bigl(w\\Vdash_{\\mathfrak M_W}\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\\in w\\bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}model}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\Bigl[\nW\\neq\\varnothing\\land W\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\operatorname{ModalFm}_{93})\n\\land R\\subseteq W^2\\land V:\\mathrm{At}_{93}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\n\\land\\mathfrak M_W=\\langle W,R,V\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall w,v\\in W\\;\n\\Bigl(\\langle w,v\\rangle\\in R\\leftrightarrow\n\\{\\psi\\in\\operatorname{ModalFm}_{93}:\\operatorname{MBox}_{93}(\\psi)\\in w\\}\\subseteq v\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall p\\in\\mathrm{At}_{93}\\;\n\\bigl(V(p)=\\{w\\in W:p\\in w\\}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall w\\in W\\;\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\operatorname{ModalFm}_{93}\\;\\Bigl(\n(\\operatorname{MNeg}_{93}(\\varphi)\\in w\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\\notin w)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}\\land\n(\\operatorname{MAnd}_{93}(\\varphi,\\psi)\\in w\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\\in w\\land\\psi\\in w)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}\\land\n(\\operatorname{MBox}_{93}(\\varphi)\\in w\\leftrightarrow\\forall v\\in W\\;(\\langle w,v\\rangle\\in R\\to\\varphi\\in v))\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{KrModel}_{93}(\\mathfrak M_W)\\land\n\\forall w\\in W\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{ModalFm}_{93}\\;\n\\bigl(w\\Vdash_{\\mathfrak M_W}\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\\in w\\bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Structural induction on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> proves the conclusion. For canonical models built from maximal consistent theories, the three membership equivalences in the antecedent are supplied by the classical Boolean clauses and the canonical existence lemma; they are not consequences of merely being a Kripke model.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"prop-canonical-model-—-Canonical-Membership-Model-Truth-Lemma","text":"prop-canonical-model — Canonical Membership-Model Truth Lemma","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-kripke-model","status":"resolved","id":"f3abfd23a82d3619","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-kripke-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"c2ca1af9af149e69","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-kripke-model","status":"resolved","id":"f3abfd23a82d3619","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ModalFm}_{93}=T_{\\tau^{\\Box}_{93}}(\\mathrm{At}_{93})$ is the local modal formula carrier of [[93-df-kripke-model]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-kripke-model","status":"resolved","id":"f3abfd23a82d3619","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{KrModel}_{93}$, $\\Vdash_{\\mathfrak M_W}$, and $\\operatorname{MNeg}_{93},\\operatorname{MAnd}_{93},\\operatorname{MBox}_{93}$ are the model, satisfaction, and tagged constructor notions of [[93-df-kripke-model]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{ModalFm}_{93}=T_{\\tau^{\\Box}_{93}}(\\mathrm{At}_{93})","display":false},{"tex":"W\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\operatorname{ModalFm}_{93})","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq W^2","display":false},{"tex":"V:\\mathrm{At}_{93}\\to\\mathcal P(W)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M_W=\\langle W,R,V\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KrModel}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Vdash_{\\mathfrak M_W}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MNeg}_{93},\\operatorname{MAnd}_{93},\\operatorname{MBox}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}model}\\vdash{}&\n\\Bigl[\nW\\neq\\varnothing\\land W\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\operatorname{ModalFm}_{93})\n\\land R\\subseteq W^2\\land V:\\mathrm{At}_{93}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\n\\land\\mathfrak M_W=\\langle W,R,V\\rangle\\\\\n&\\land\\forall w,v\\in W\\;\n\\Bigl(\\langle w,v\\rangle\\in R\\leftrightarrow\n\\{\\psi\\in\\operatorname{ModalFm}_{93}:\\operatorname{MBox}_{93}(\\psi)\\in w\\}\\subseteq v\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall p\\in\\mathrm{At}_{93}\\;\n\\bigl(V(p)=\\{w\\in W:p\\in w\\}\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall w\\in W\\;\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\operatorname{ModalFm}_{93}\\;\\Bigl(\n(\\operatorname{MNeg}_{93}(\\varphi)\\in w\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\\notin w)\\\\\n&\\hspace{8em}\\land\n(\\operatorname{MAnd}_{93}(\\varphi,\\psi)\\in w\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\\in w\\land\\psi\\in w)\\\\\n&\\hspace{8em}\\land\n(\\operatorname{MBox}_{93}(\\varphi)\\in w\\leftrightarrow\\forall v\\in W\\;(\\langle w,v\\rangle\\in R\\to\\varphi\\in v))\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&\\to\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{KrModel}_{93}(\\mathfrak M_W)\\land\n\\forall w\\in W\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{ModalFm}_{93}\\;\n\\bigl(w\\Vdash_{\\mathfrak M_W}\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\\in w\\bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false}],"bytes":2508,"back